ing. Gateways can be installed anywhere without requiring external power. Industrial Installation Mounting design allows quick installation on equipment housings, building exteriors, or any location where your assets need monitoring Compact & Rugged 146mm × 87mm × 57mm (5.75″ × 3.43″ × 2.24″) form factor withstands industrial environments while maintaining a small footprint Deploy Networks , Not Just Sensors Deploy Monitoring Networks in Minutes The Atomation Gateway intelligently manages your monitoring network to maximize efficiency and battery life. Multi-Atom Connectivity Supports numerous Atoms simultaneously, with the optimal number determined by your use case, event frequency, and data consumption patterns Exception-Based Communication Works seamlessly with Atomation’s patented edge-computing architecture. Atoms process data locally and only transmit when thresholds are exceeded, minimizing cellular data usage and extending battery life across the entire network. Automatic Cellular Connection Self-configures on deployment, automatically searching for and establishing the strongest available cellular signal with immediate dashboard confirmation Centralized Configuration Link Atoms to the Gateway through the online dashboard with no field programming or complex setup procedures required Low Battery Monitoring The Gateway actively tracks its own battery status, sending alerts before replacement is needed to prevent service interruption The Result An intelligent wireless network that manages itself, conserves power, and delivers actionable information when it matters, all without IT support. No Complex Installation. No Infrastructure Requirements. 01 Mount Attach to equipment or structures using mounting hardware or the optional magnetic base 02 Activate Review settings via the Atomation dashboard 03 Link Atoms Assign Atoms to the Gateway through simple dashboard configuration 04 Monitor Immediate cloud connectivity provides visibility to all connected equipment 